#
# Form IT-2105.9 (2025), New York's underpayment of estimated tax form, the
# latest published: Parts 1 and 2 and Schedule A of Part 3 on page 1,
# Schedule B on page 2. One anchor per line the estimated tax rules fill.
# Part 2, the short method, is not filled: the rules figure every penalty by
# the regular method. Page numbers count the PDF's pages from 1.

